<view class="page" wx:if="{{found}}"><image class="scene" src="/assets/{{profile.illustrationId}}.png" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="card"><view class="huge">{{profile.type}}</view><view class="title">{{profile.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{profile.summary}}</view><view class="tiny">原创偏好探索，非官方认证测试或诊断。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="subtitle">四维倾向 · 不是准确率</view><view wx:for="{{record.result.dimensions}}" wx:key="dimension"><view class="row"><text>{{item.dimension}} · {{item.value}}</text><text class="tiny">{{item.balanced?'接近均衡':''}}</text></view><view class="bar"><view class="fill" style="width:{{item.firstPercent}}%"/></view><view class="row tiny"><text>{{item.dimension[0]}} {{item.firstPercent}}%</text><text style="text-align:right">{{item.dimension[1]}} {{100-item.firstPercent}}%</text></view><view class="tiny" wx:if="{{item.balanced}}">建议结合日常体验理解。{{item.tie?'得分为零，字母按固定规则展示，存在不确定性。':''}}</view></view></view><view wx:for="{{sections}}" wx:key="title" class="card"><view data-i="{{index}}" bindtap="toggle" class="subtitle">{{item.title}} {{open===index?'−':'＋'}}</view><view wx:if="{{open===index}}" wx:for="{{item.items}}" wx:for-item="line" wx:key="*this" class="list-item">{{line}}</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="poster">生成分享卡 / 保存分享图</button><button class="secondary" open-type="share">分享给好友</button><view class="row"><button class="secondary" bindtap="again">再测一次</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="history">查看测试历史</button></view></view><view wx:else class="empty">记录不存在或已删除，请从测试页重新开始。</view>